WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:04.505
The Russians
put the first man on the moon.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.798
That’s steps away from nuclear war.

00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:08.008
There’s no going back.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.051
(dramatic music playing)

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.428
 A three-way race to Mars.

00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:13.472
We’re not gonna
come in second place again.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:16.141
Eli: Today, we take the next step

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:21.063
towards a self-sustaining Mars colony.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.357
♪ "Take Me Out" by Franz Ferdinand ♪

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.234
♪

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:27.194
Miles: They’re looking for guys
just like us.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:30.822
This job on Mars, I could be doing
something that I never even dreamed of.

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:33.367
♪ I say take me out ♪

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.912
For the next two years of your lives,
Mars is your new home.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:39.206
♪ Take me out ♪

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:40.624
Danielle: What’s happened?

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:43.377
Palmer: Something incredible.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.839
This asteroid, it could change everything
for people back home.

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.132
Aledia: There’s more oridium
in the asteroid

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:51.844
than has been mined
in the entire history of Earth.

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:53.220
♪ I want you ♪

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:56.348
Dev: We can capture the most valuable
known object in our solar system.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:59.184
Eli: North Koreans, CIA, KGB,

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:00.435
they’re all wanting a piece of this pie.

00:01:00.811 --> 00:01:03.438
Karen: Is it about justice
or filling your pockets?

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:05.357
What are you gonna do
with all that money if you’re dead?

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:08.485
I always thought
I’d go out in a blaze of glory.

00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:09.820
♪ To take me out ♪

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:10.946
(yelling)

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:12.865
♪ This could die ♪

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:14.533
Danielle: I’m gonna get that rock
or die trying.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.535
Karen: We are powerless up here.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:19.121
A millions of miles from my family,
this isn’t what it was supposed to be.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.415
Karen: People are gonna keep getting hurt

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:24.042
while your bank accounts
grow bigger and bigger.

00:01:24.126 --> 00:01:25.252
(grunts)

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:26.962
(dramatic music playing)

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:31.008
We’re building a new world for our future.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.467
Ed: You ready to make history?

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:33.969
Always, my friend.

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:36.138
♪ I want you ♪

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.308
♪ To take me out ♪

